B.baa=new A.a7("What Steady is","Steady connects you with your psychologist between sessions. You can record how you are feeling, complete questionnaires and exercises your psychologist sends you, and, if you choose, share a daily summary of your watch data.")
B.bau=new A.a7("What is collected","Your name and email address; your check-ins and anything you write in them; your answers to questionnaires and exercises; and, only if you turn it on, daily summaries of heart rate, sleep, steps and blood oxygen from your watch. Also some technical details: the app version and kind of phone, your time zone, a notification token so the app can tell you when something new arrives, and the internet address you connect from, which the practice keeps in its access log for security.")
B.baR=new A.a7("Who can see it","Your own psychologist. Another psychologist at the practice only if your psychologist shares your record with them (for supervision or cover); you can see who in Settings. The practice's master clinician and administrator see your name and whether your app is set up and connected, not what you share. Your psychologist may add what you share to your clinical record at the practice; if the practice uses an AI note-taking service, its consent statement says so. OpenWorks IT runs the practice's server on its behalf: it can technically reach the server to keep it running, does not read patients' information, and is bound to keep it confidential. Your information is not sold, not used for advertising, and not shared with anyone else unless the law requires it.")
B.bab=new A.a7("How it is protected","Information travels over encrypted connections and is stored on the practice's own servers in South Africa. Your psychologist can only see their own patients, and who opens your record, and when, is logged. Practice staff sign in with a password, a code and a device they have linked. Notifications reach Android phones through Google's Firebase Cloud Messaging and iPhones through Apple, and only ever say \"New notification\": never your name, scores or what you wrote. Emails to you are only about your account (such as a deletion you asked for) and never contain what you shared.")
B.bb3=new A.a7("Your rights under POPIA","Your information is handled under the Protection of Personal Information Act. You may ask to see it, to correct it, or to have it deleted (subject to the practice's duty to keep clinical records), and you may stop using the app or stop sharing watch data at any time. You may also complain to the Information Regulator of South Africa. Ask your psychologist for the practice's Information Officer details.")
B.bax=new A.a7("Not an emergency service","Nobody watches Steady around the clock. If you need help urgently, use the crisis numbers shown in the app.")
B.aZb=s([B.baa,B.bau,B.baR,B.bab,B.bb3,B.bax],t.Wy)
